This grant covers only copyright owned by Nanaloveyuki, including owned code,
documentation, configuration and original content in AdvancedRimTalk,
IrisMenus, Oxygen-Dsl-Framework, ODF-Mods, RadiusUI-MissionControl-Fixes,
Ratkin_Hunger_and_Havoc, RimCarbon14, RimIrisShaders, KeepYourIdentity,
rimworld-washingmachine-play and the owned additions to Lead-Your-Pets.
The owned research writing in MultiFloor-fork is also covered, but not the
investigated MultiFloors software or third-party excerpts reproduced there.

Exceptions and retained rights

- Lead-Your-Pets: original code and assets belong to 乐织终. NOTICE records
  permission dated 2026-09-09 to continue and modify with attribution. That
  permission is not an upstream MIT or Apache-2.0 grant. Only additions owned
  by Nanaloveyuki are dual licensed; the original permission still governs
  upstream material and must not be broadened by this license.
- MultiFloor-fork: only the owned research document is licensed here.
  MultiFloors modification/distribution permission remains unconfirmed;
  Prepatcher's MIT license does not extend to MultiFloors.
- rimworld-washingmachine-play: ownership/license of the user-supplied
  474eeca1ed0a4ccaec86d1ab9705bde8_720.png is not established here. That image,
  its derived Textures/Things/Building/WashingMachine/ images and
  About/Preview.png are excluded from this grant. No new redistribution
  permission for those assets is asserted.
- SaveYourStorage-and-Tick-Every-Minute and OhYouAreSoFast retain their
  existing MIT licenses. Their project LICENSE files govern those directories;
  migration does not add an Apache-2.0 grant to their existing content.
- prisoner_pay_to_eat_fork: vendored from ikun2522-art/PPTE2, copyright
  (c) 2026 AAA不玩抽象. Its original MIT LICENSE governs this directory;
  inclusion in this monorepo does not add an Apache-2.0 grant.
- ratkin_recycle: original work by 菜地里的稽, continued by Nanaloveyuki.
  Based on the maintainer's confirmation of the original author's permission,
  this project is offered under MIT OR Apache-2.0. Its project LICENSE and
  NOTICE govern the authorized work; original authorship is retained.
- Third-party code, binaries, libraries, assets, fonts, quoted source and
  other material are not relicensed. Their original copyright notices,
  license texts and attribution requirements remain effective, including
  NOTICE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES files and bundled Blockly, CodeMirror,
  .NET and other dependency notices. RimWorld, Unity and other external mod
  components remain governed by their respective rightsholders.
- Existing nested license copies, including Tools/vscode/LICENSE, remain
  intact. For the Nanaloveyuki-owned VSCode extensions, the adjacent scoped
  LICENSE-APACHE supplies the Apache-2.0 alternative to the preserved MIT
  grant. It does not change the license of any third-party bundled material.

The presence of either canonical license text does not itself license every
file, asset or dependency in this repository. If ownership or permission is
unclear, no additional rights to that material are granted by this notice.
Existing grants and third-party notices remain in effect.
